            make_q("What are the 'gradients' ($g_i$) and 'Hessians' ($h_i$) in XGBoost?", ["Hardware drivers", "First-order partial derivatives and second-order partial derivatives of the loss function with respect to the prediction", "Hyperparameters set by the user", "Column indices in the dataset"], 1, "$g_i$ is the first derivative (slope) and $h_i$ is the second derivative (curvature) of the loss function at sample $i$."),
