            make_q("What are the `reg_alpha` and `reg_lambda` hyperparameters in XGBoost and LightGBM?", ["Alpha is $L_1$ regularization (Lasso); Lambda is $L_2$ regularization (Ridge) applied to leaf weights", "Alpha is learning rate; Lambda is tree depth", "They are random noise seeds", "They control thread counts"], 0, "`reg_alpha` enforces $L_1$ sparsity on leaf weights; `reg_lambda` enforces $L_2$ weight shrinkage to prevent extreme predictions."),
